sqlglot-js is produced by line-by-line transliteration of sqlglot's source
(each ported file carries a `// py: <upstream-path>:<line>` anchor to its
origin), and its test corpus (corpus/) is harvested verbatim from sqlglot's
own test suite (tests/dialects/*.py) via the declarative validate_identity
and validate_all calls used throughout that suite.

